{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of costumes, equipment, and dyes inspired by the mysterious beauty of the night, perfect for the Halloween season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri Apparel and Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant Twilight Dress, Twilight Elegance for Kids, Soft Kid's Black Cat, Black Cat Baby Suit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small Demon Wings Black, Small Devil Wings Red, Black Angel Wings, Wings of Ena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbDyes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Sky Hair Dye, Inferno Hair Dye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ihm Color: Graphite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021470?t=1760954677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap